# ── Build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All meson builds go in the top-level build/ directory.
# Per-project standalone builds also use build/ inside each project.
**/build*/

**/bin/
**/lib/
# Vendored upstream subprojects ship their library sources in `lib/`.
# Allow those back in.
!subprojects/*/lib/
!subprojects/*/lib/**
# n00b's own stdlib lives at top-level `lib/std/` and is loaded at
# runtime by the embedded-eval session (`src/n00b/eval.c` via
# `N00B_BUILTINS_PATH`) and by the REPL.
!/lib/
!/lib/**

# Compiled objects (shouldn't appear outside build/ but just in case)
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.lib
*.exe

